{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19267","headline":"奉和吏部杨尚书太常李卿二相公策免後即事述怀赠答十韵 · 刘禹锡","name":"奉和吏部杨尚书太常李卿二相公策免後即事述怀赠答十韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"文雅关西族，衣冠赵北都。\n有声真汉相，无纇胜隋珠。\n当轴龙爲友，临池凤不孤。\n九天开内殿，百辟看晨趋。\n诫满澄欹器，成功别大罏。\n余芳在公论，积庆是神扶。\n步武离台席，徊翔集帝梧。\n诠材秉秦镜，典乐去齐竽。\n潇洒风尘外，逢迎诗酒徒。\n唯应待华诰，更食万钱厨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19267.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19267","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}